title: The Youth League
subtitle: The Communist Youth wants a bigger role.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_youth_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_youth_timer = 4

= The Youth League

The Communist Youth League is impatient: it wants its own papers, its own hikes and a say in the party's line.

- @support
- @control

@support
title: Give them money and freedom.
subtitle: More members; the young are drawn to the <span class="f-left">Left</span>. Costs 1 resource.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
Q.members += 4;
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 2});
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Youth groups march with red flags and guitars.

@control
title: Keep them under the Zentrale's control.
subtitle: Pleases the leadership; the youth sulk.
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.leader + '_dissent'] -= 2;
Q.members -= 1;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The youth league gets a new secretary from the Zentrale.
